<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes have hit two power stations in eastern Sudan, causing a widespread blackout and prompting Sudan to lodge complaints with the UN and African Union against Ethiopia for cross-border attacks. The RSF continues to use drones against civilian infrastructure, while the UN is preparing talks with the RSF on a civilian transition. Sudan’s government has accused Ethiopia of supporting the attacks, and the conflict has expanded to include disputes over the power grid. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOcWZNaEhDNTUzQnM0bHItQUlLX1ZxT3h6N3hqWGJLV3p3T2o2NHRnZTZGcDg4bG5OOEE5N0pFNHVHWGNTSHljNS1nVVY5ajNkTVpWV1R3RXFuLS1tYlhjRzNJbmNvYUVyNF9xWDhlYkZGMWNSU3Q5bUxFakRtcFVyaHBKQmo2ekJM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOdnFETFM1b1oyWEZ1RzhKVU9jM05rdjJTdGo0ZVVTalFob2lFTmZIMXMzSTc0RUhtUDZSUVRzcDc2cUZSdXBxR1lJUE5GcHVaQ0lLM3VhZUs1TGxPMDVBdzRaZUI0bEZpNS1Ba2FIR08xeWZZMTRzblNBNkpMZDRyVDZNVmZyNnBmMnF0SHFQRGN5QWMzeTFFVEJTX2d0TXBYbmhpNTd6UlVjMU4zNnhZWktSVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOTERRZHAyeTQzTW50c3dfTlNMM2dEOUptQ29OcFZlbVFud3JVWXdLNTRfSzhGWEQ2ZkZDMGFEVEVHR1pqMXQ4SHVlSE9QM0dRbWdNX1BuV2JNWGREb1BJeWZhMXYzR0xqYTlpYWd5NURhNk9NQTdDalZLcUxFWmVtT3pPWVhTWUJGeF91V0lZblF3Z1VaYTYtbkpaUTlhYjYxLUpEbVVPSjZOc0xGLU9mdGpmTDFQd0c4UVVuRnU4OVdtUDVw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Türkiye Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPM2htNElQUjlLRndqUnIxbmZoRzZNVnB4RkdneXM5N1pGSHRZbmh0SE82aXpISVJiaG8wbFEwNXFNVGNyUS1MS3lFZEVJU3lqdWJMZlFjYmRoWVFYZWRSb011UmhOMjE1M3Q3b3l